# Build context for the generic surface-host image (BuildKit picks this up in
# preference to the repo-root .dockerignore when building with
# `-f deploy/surface-host/Dockerfile`).
#
# UNLIKE the root .dockerignore, this MUST keep `instances/` in context: the
# surface shell's vite build reads ${AISHA_INSTANCE_DIR}/app.config.json (+ i18n,
# fixtures) at build time to compose the instance overlay. Excluding it (as the
# root ignore does, for the token-exchange service image) breaks the shell build
# with `ENOENT app.config.json`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
db
scripts
# …except the one script `npm ci` itself runs: package.json declares
# `"preinstall": "node scripts/check-node.cjs"`, so without this the install
# fails with `npm error command sh -c node scripts/check-node.cjs`. Keep the
# rest of scripts/ out — the image has no business carrying the toolshed.
!scripts/check-node.cjs
*.md
